/*
========================================
REGEX CHEAT SHEET — DSA
========================================

1. CHARACTER SETS
----------------------------------------
[a-z]           lowercase letters
[A-Z]           uppercase letters
[0-9]           numbers
[a-zA-Z]        any letter
[a-zA-Z0-9]     letters + numbers

[^...]          NOT these characters

Examples:
[^0-9]          anything except numbers
[^a-zA-Z]       anything except letters
[^a-z0-9]       anything except lowercase letters/numbers


2. SHORTCUTS
----------------------------------------
\d              digit (0-9)
\s              whitespace
.               any character


3. QUANTIFIERS
----------------------------------------
*               0 or more
+               1 or more
?               0 or 1

Examples:
a*              "", "a", "aa", "aaa"
a+              "a", "aa", "aaa"
a?              "", "a"


4. POSITION
----------------------------------------
^               beginning of string
$               end of string

Examples:
^hello          starts with "hello"
hello$          ends with "hello"


5. FLAGS
----------------------------------------
g               find all matches
i               ignore uppercase/lowercase

Example:
/hello/gi       find all "hello", ignoring case


6. replace()
----------------------------------------

Remove all digits:
"abc123".replace(/[0-9]/g, "")
// "abc"

Remove all special characters:
"hello@#$".replace(/[^a-zA-Z0-9]/g, "")
// "hello"

Keep only letters and numbers:
"Hello @123!".replace(/[^a-zA-Z0-9]/g, "")
// "Hello123"

Ignore case:
"Hello WORLD".replace(/[^a-z0-9]/gi, "")
// "HelloWORLD"


========================================
MOST IMPORTANT FOR DSA
========================================

/[a-z]/g              → lowercase letters
/[A-Z]/g              → uppercase letters
/[0-9]/g              → digits
/[^a-zA-Z0-9]/g       → special characters

Common palindrome cleaning:

s = s.toLowerCase().replace(/[^a-z0-9]/gi, "");

Example:
"A man, a plan!"
        ↓
"a man, a plan!"
        ↓
"amanaplan"

========================================
*/